# A run produces its artifacts in the working directory. If someone runs the
# pipeline from inside this clone, none of it belongs in the repo. Anchored to
# the root on purpose: sample-run/context and fixtures/llm are shipped examples
# and unanchored patterns silently swallowed them.
/context/
/keywords/
/briefs/
/drafts/
/llm/
/serps/
/review/
/pages/
/*.csv
